&lt;li&gt;Passion for AI and interest in responsible development of advanced systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A knack for bringing order to chaos and an enthusiastic &quot;roll up your sleeves&quot; mentality—you&#39;re a true team player and view yourself as the COO of your customer accounts&lt;/li&gt;
