&lt;p&gt;As the Manager, Startup Partnerships at Anthropic, you&#39;ll lead a high-performing and technical team of startup partners focused on driving adoption of Anthropic&#39;s AI solutions across the startup landscape while ensuring responsible AI deployment. As a leadership role on the startups GTM team, you will lead a multi-functional team working across accelerators, incubators, and ecosystem partners across mature and emerging markets. The team’s goal is to obsess over winning day-zero founders globally and expand our customer base to ensure every new AI startup chooses to build on Claude.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be instrumental in establishing Anthropic&#39;s presence in the global startup ecosystem, driving pipeline and new logos to startup sales across multiple regions. This role requires someone who thrives in ambiguity, can build from the ground up in new markets, and is driven to deliver exceptional results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
