&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have a strong portfolio of produced events demonstrating your ability to manage complex, multi-element productions from concept through execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are deeply knowledgeable about technical production disciplines including audio, video, lighting, LED, staging, and content playback systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have extensive experience developing run-of-show documentation and calling or directing live shows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
