&lt;p&gt;This is a critical leadership role responsible for building and scaling Anthropic&#39;s consulting partner ecosystem and AI-native boutique partners across Australia and New Zealand (ANZ) region. You will own the strategic roadmap, investment prioritization, development plans, and revenue accountability for a portfolio of partnerships that will collectively become critical drivers of Anthropic&#39;s enterprise growth.&lt;strong&gt; This is a builder role, not a manager role.&lt;/strong&gt; Given Anthropic&#39;s stage, we need someone who has proven they can take partnerships from zero to scaled revenue engines — someone who has built these relationships from the ground up, not just inherited and managed existing ones.&lt;/p&gt;
