&lt;li&gt;Partner with management to build a culture of high performance grounded in Anthropic&#39;s values, ensuring performance management and employee relations matters are handled in accordance with applicable law and best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In collaboration with specialist teams, leadership, and finance, design and implement scalable programs and policies to attract, retain, and develop outstanding talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with People Infrastructure, Legal, and Compliance to ensure the right operational foundations are in place across our offices&lt;/li&gt;
