&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in HR, People Operations, Employee Relations, or a closely related function, with meaningful exposure to GTM or commercial teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating HR and employment policies at a global company, including understanding of relevant legal and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
