&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong product design instincts and the ability to produce a clean, usable interface without a dedicated designer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with browser automation, desktop automation, or robotic process automation systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building evals or quality harnesses for machine learning systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfort with lightweight data analysis, such as SQL, notebooks, and defining and tracking product metrics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience designing agent loops, tool integrations, or guardrails for LLM-based systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
