&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s total compensation package for this role includes a competitive salary, equity, and a comprehensive benefits package. Benefits are tailored to the country of employment and typically include health coverage, generous parental leave, flexible time off, and retirement provisions in line with local norms. Specific details will be shared during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
