&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of backend or developer infrastructure engineering experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Rust or Go&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
