&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with Bazel, Buck, Nix, or similar hermetic build systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience operating as a platform tech lead — broad context across the stack and a history of cross-team influence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
