&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rebuilding the dev container image pipeline so a new engineer goes from git clone to a running environment in under 60 seconds&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designing an ephemeral environment system that gives every branch its own isolated copy of downstream services&lt;/p&gt;
