&lt;li&gt;Private, public, and hybrid cloud: how our database footprint spans owned, cloud, and mixed environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role is a highly available, 24x7x365 database infrastructure that every Anthropic service can depend on, across regions, clouds, and deployment models.&lt;/p&gt;
